<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The system incorporates a Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\) module that allows users to query past inspections and OEM documentation through natural language. When a user asks any IC-related question, the RAG engine retrieves the relevant sections from stored OEM PDFs and previous inspection records, providing context-aware answers. It highlights the exact referenced segments, enabling users to quickly verify specifications, understand marking formats, and cross-check component details with authoritative sources.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
