267 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Catering to the use cases highlighted by the BEL representatives during the online webinar, our system focuses on reliably identifying ICs on FPGA boards and routing them through a dedicated verification workflow. These components are then individually analyzed to determine their authenticity using our automated AOI-VLM pipeline. This approach ensures high-precision detection of counterfeit or mismarked ICs, addressing a critical need in high-reliability electronics. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
