374 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Electronics repair centers, component distributors, small-to-mid-scale manufacturers, and PCB assembly units face significant operational and financial risks due to counterfeit ICs entering their supply chain. Our software enables these businesses to automate large-scale IC verification by uploading batches of images, instantly detecting marking inconsistencies, packaging anomalies, or suspected counterfeits without relying on skilled technicians. Each inspection generates a detailed, downloadable report that teams can query through natural language, and the platform provides a business dashboard showing key metrics such as number of defects detected, types of anomalies, supplier-wise risk patterns, and inspection trends. This helps businesses improve quality control, reduce returns and failures, and maintain a more reliable component pipeline.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
